1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,620
You told me the odds were unbeatable

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:06,180
And I know what stage four means

3
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:09,300
But you never told me I was unbreakable

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,780
Or what a promise does to me

5
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:14,660
So I took a look at my shadow

6
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:17,700
Saw the dirt still on my boots

7
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,100
Quit staring at the clock

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:23,140
And I started digging roots

9
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:26,420
Then I looked at my family, and I told them what I'd do

10
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:29,140
I don't give out promises unless I know they're true

11
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:33,140
So I never said I'd beat it, I just swore I'd fight it through

12
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:39,540
I was living to die with a white flag in my hand

13
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:44,740
Now I'm dying to live every hour that I can

14
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:50,820
I stopped begging for more time, and I started giving time more life

15
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:55,300
I was living to die, now I'm dying to live
